      "content": "but taking care of myself has just made it worse. the more i \"try,\" the more i fail, and the more they suffer for it. it feels like my existence is the very thing keeping them from being happy. if i wasn't even a factor in their lives, they could finally just have a normal, happy family. wouldn't it be better for everyone if i just wasn't around to cause all this stress?",
